cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these packings or tools, please cite them as below."
title: "Moki&Julio: 5,421 new best-known packings of equal circles, spheres and hyperspheres in nineteen Packomania containers"
authors:
  - name: "Moki&Julio"
date-released: 2026-09-26
version: "2.4"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - circle packing
  - equal circles
  - Packomania
  - best-known packings
  - exact certificates
abstract: >-
  5,421 packings that improve the best-known records of Packomania's tables: equal circles in the isosceles right
  triangle (crt), the circular quadrant (ccq), eight fixed rectangles (crc_100 to crc_800), the semicircle (csc), the unit square
  (csq) and the regular pentagon (cpt), 15-gon (cpd) and 16-gon (cxd), equal spheres in the unit cube (scu), and equal balls in the
  unit ball of dimension 4 (hsp4), dimension 5 (hsp5), dimension 6 (hsp6), each with an exact certificate verified by two independently written exact checkers. Results
  already surpassed in the literature (including spherical-code constructions) are excluded by a prior-art gate. Also: 58 table
  entries proven optimal by Füredi's bound for thin rectangles and two proven optimal by an exact computer-assisted proof.
